                         518 --118:  [Description]\n
                         519 --119:  Callback function for turning ON/OFF the life signal. Called by the VRUN 
                         520 --120:  periodic handler.
                         521 --122:  Turn the four life signals ON/OFF in the following order using the 
                         522 --123:  vrun_set_signal_high and vrun_set_signal_low functions.\n
                         523 --124:  1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 3 -> 2 -> 1 (return to the beginning)\n
                         524 --125:  * In this sample, the life signal is assigned to the LED on the development 
                         525 --126:    board, so the LED blinks according to the state of the life signal. 
                         526 --128:  [Parameters]\n
