                         900 --208:  "icum" sub-menu
                         901 --210:  [Description]\n
                         902 --211:  "icum" sub-menu entry
                         903 --212:  The following function names are expanded by the VRUN_USR_CMD macro.\n
                         904 --213:     const char CMD_USR_4 [] = "icum";\n
                         905 --214:     void vrun_cmd_usr_4 (void)\n
                         906 --215:  The above function is called from the vrun module according to the selection 
                         907 --216:  from the main menu.
                         908 --218:  In this function, the submenu screen is displayed, and the target service is 
                         909 --219:  displayed from the numerical value entered according to the screen.\n
                         910 --220:  Call a function group that describes sample code that uses a command.
                         911 --222:  [Parameters]\n
                         912 --223:  None
                         913 --225:  [Return value]\n
                         914 --226:  None
                         915 --227: */
